@fact corvin.locks
# en: Knows every locked door in the academy and owes money to at least three people.
text [8de015] = 学院里每一扇锁着的门他都知道，而且至少欠着三个人的钱。

@fact corvin.last_warning
# en: He is on his last warning. One more detention and they send him home, and home is not a good place.
text [b33ba6] = 他已经是最后一次警告了。再被罚一次禁闭，就会被送回家——而家，不是个好地方。
# en: One more detention would cost him more than an evening.
hint [1d211f] = 再多一次禁闭，他要付出的就不只是一个晚上了。

@fact corvin.brother
# en: His brother turns up for money and threatens to tell the headmistress where Corvin learned to pick locks.
text [bb32a8] = 他哥哥会找上门来要钱，还威胁要告诉院长科尔文是在哪儿学会撬锁的。
# en: Not all of his family writes kindly.
hint [80f55b] = 他的家人，并不都写客气的信。

@fact corvin.grandfather
# en: His grandfather's lucky deck sat in the confiscation vault for decades. It really is lucky.
text [26a338] = 他祖父的幸运牌在没收品库里躺了几十年。那副牌是真的幸运。
# en: The confiscation vault keeps more than contraband.
hint [3c9872] = 没收库里锁着的，不只是违禁品。

@fact corvin.cartographers
# en: He runs the Midnight Cartographers, the club that doesn't exist.
text [d80fd1] = 他是午夜制图社的头儿——那个不存在的社团。
# en: Some clubs don't put up posters.
hint [2083ec] = 有些社团从不贴招新告示。

@fact corvin.trolls
# en: He once owed thirty crowns to trolls and offered to pay you back with a goat.
text [976180] = 他曾欠巨魔三十克朗，还提出用一只山羊来还你钱。
# en: Ask him about money, if you dare.
hint [e56845] = 敢的话，问问他钱的事。

@fact corvin.sundays
# en: His grandfather could find a lost thing in any house, and taught him to shuffle on rainy Sundays. He's the one person Corvin talks about without a joke.
text [6974c6] = 他祖父能在任何房子里找到丢失的东西，还在下雨的星期天教他洗牌。那是科尔文唯一不开玩笑地谈起的人。
# en: There's one person he talks about without a joke.
hint [1634b5] = 有一个人，他提起时从不开玩笑。

@fact corvin.master_map
# en: The Cartographers' last Keeper left him the Master Map this summer. Whoever draws two lines in its old blanks keeps it with him.
text [4b3e8d] = 制图社的上一任保管人今年夏天把总图留给了他。谁能在总图那两块老空白里画上两道线，就和他一起保管它。
# en: Ask what the Cartographers keep.
hint [42990d] = 问问制图社保管着什么。
